			9 - LINE-1
			10 - LINE-2
			-----------------------------
			Values:
			1 - Cooling circuit supported for XFP transmitter. 
			0 - Cooling circuit not supported for XFP transmitter.
			-----------------------------"
		::= { ommp82PlusCardGeneralDetailsEntry 76 }

